### Health Child Tracker - Vaccine Reminder API Testing
### ✅ FIXED: Sử dụng đúng data structure và mapper

### Variables
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7000
@token = your-jwt-token-here
@adminToken = your-admin-jwt-token-here

### 1. Test Vaccine Reminder Email (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/test-email
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-test-email@gmail.com",
  "emailType": "vaccine"
}

### 2. Test Appointment Reminder Email (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/test-email
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-test-email@gmail.com",
  "emailType": "appointment"
}

### 3. Test Vaccination Completion Email (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/test-email
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "your-test-email@gmail.com",
  "emailType": "completion"
}

### 4. Get Upcoming Vaccine Reminders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/upcoming-vaccine-reminders?daysAhead=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Upcoming Appointment Reminders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/upcoming-appointment-reminders?daysAhead=3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Send Manual Vaccine Reminder (replace with actual IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/send-vaccine-reminder/1/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Send Manual Appointment Reminder (replace with actual ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/send-appointment-reminder/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Send Vaccination Completion Notification (replace with actual IDs)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/send-completion-notification/1/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Trigger Daily Reminders Manually (Admin only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vaccinereminder/trigger-daily-reminders
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. Test Authentication (to get token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountName": "your-username",
  "password": "your-password"
}

###
